## Private sections

These sections are marked private in `.crate/config.toml`:

$section_list

They're gitignored: that text never enters git at all, and stays on this machine.

So: **read them for context when I ask. Never write anything derived from them into `wiki/`.**
`wiki/` is committed; a private section isn't. Synthesizing a private note into a page walks it
across the exact line the gitignore exists to hold, and the gitignore can't stop you — only this
rule can.

If something in there seems worth a page, tell me and I'll decide.
